    description: "Parent item WI-darad-nozut-hudum-jalug-digoh-tapuz-vojav-lumiv carries an unvalidated bakeoff claim. Cohort cohort-001/iter-010 produced plurality verdict no_move (moved=0 no_move=3 inconclusive=0). Evidence: alertmanager=no_move: io-boundaries.txt for net_send shows leaf_callers=[] and entry_points_per_leaf={} for every boundary type; the notify/ut…; kafka=no_move: io-boundaries.txt net_send section still shows JsonRestServer.httpRequest as a single chain with entry_points=[], not on…; prometheus=no_move: io-boundaries.txt for prometheus shows leaf_callers=[] and entry_points_per_leaf={} for all 12 boundaries; the notifier/….\n\nInvestigate why the claimed metric did not move: either the fix did not land as expected, the claim was overstated, or the cohort is an unfair test (in which case the parent verdict should be re-run against a different cohort and this regression item closed as wont_do with that rationale)."  # 8553
