- op: discuss  # d39d
  at: '2026-04-25T22:33:45Z'  # d39d
  by: agent  # d39d
  actor: jgstern_agent  # d39d
  clock: 5  # d39d
  nonce: d39d  # d39d
  message: "Fixed in PR #3370 (commit 4f2deb0d0). Root cause was structural: cmd_io_boundaries reconstructs BoundaryMapEntry in its filter pass and previously omitted leaf_callers / entry_points_per_leaf from the dataclass construction, so the WI-darad fix in compute_boundary_map was silently stripped before serialization for every CLI invocation with the default exclude_tests=True. Fix extracts compute_leaf_rollups as a public io_boundary helper and has the CLI filter path lazily build the reverse graph and recompute rollups for the surviving chain subset. The next DEEP cohort that re-runs alertmanager/kafka/prometheus should see non-empty leaf_callers per net_send/fs_read/fs_write boundary, validating WI-darad's original metric-movement claim. WI-darad's awaits_bakeoff_validation tag stays on until that re-validation lands."  # d39d
